  "provenance": "combat.room_encounters places a cast and says nothing about what any of it looks like; the block world drew all of it as one red box, so a rat and a boss were the same object at the same size. Sharing the hero's rig is the point rather than a coincidence — one animation vocabulary means a mob and a player can be driven by the same code."
